      "demand shifts right; supply shifts left"
    ],
    requiredParts: [],
    relationships: [
      "price is set by producer and consumer interaction",
      "demand right raises equilibrium price and quantity",
      "supply left raises price and lowers quantity",
      "equilibrium occurs where quantity supplied equals quantity demanded"
